From de742541276462cff3b51ab774fa040f7011476a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@example.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 06:32:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Patch 12: Albums - device folders list and album detail

- Albums tab: grid of device folders with cover and item count (Camera pinned first)
- Album detail: the same day-grouped timeline, zoom and fast scroller, scoped to one folder
- Viewer opened from an album swipes only within that album
- Extract TimelineGrid so the Pictures tab and albums share one grid
- Data source/repository/paging gain an optional bucketId filter; albums refresh on MediaStore changes
